{"title": "Potion of Animal Speaking", "pageid": 3789, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Potion_of_Animal_Speaking", "categories": ["Potions", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">\"Animal Speaking\" redirects here. For the spell, see <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Speak with Animals\">Speak with Animals</a>.    For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Speak with Animals (disambiguation)\">Speak with Animals (disambiguation)</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Faded.png/300px-POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/1/1f/POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Potion of Animal Speaking image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Faded.png/300px-POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Potion of Animal Speaking</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">Consumable</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Potions\" title=\"Potions\">Potion</a>). It has a beneficial utility effect.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A heady aroma of hay, musk, and manure greets your nose upon opening the bottle.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potions\" title=\"Potions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png/25px-Potions_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png/38px-Potions_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png/50px-Potions_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Potions\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png/25px-Potions_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potions\" title=\"Potions\">Potions</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" deco